{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 个别地方把人物尚未确定的心理解释得过于确定，例如 S09 将“想有人陪”推进成“怕孤单到连受过的气也肯再受”，比 X 更容易替人物下判断。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的优势不只是重点字放大，而是把人物心理转折和音乐感受分层呈现，普通观众可以先抓住【】里的关键意思，再通过小字和适时出现的感受词补足当下的情绪与身体体验，不必同时消化整堆信息。尤其是从舍不得、怀疑、孤独、反复挣扎到接受想念并继续生活，Y 用反复出现的“当作自己人”串起了整条心理线，音乐描述也更具体，有声响、动作、空间和身体反应的细节，因而既容易跟上，也更容易感到前后变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2307614a-07fe-48a9-b220-3fe7b29cb120", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T181835165057Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:19:38.757837+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fd821bc3cf872d14d7fed4f9c3beeb13247e9c53e1c3c6eb8b75d27aa8b8299c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683